GAPsurvey 2026.02.24 (February 24, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

NEW FUNCTIONALITY

- Added functions to extract data from TimeZero database files
  and convert to .gps files that can be imported by Poseidon
  and Wheelhouse as a backup. The primary function for conversion
  is convert_tzdb_gps(). The new functions require the RSQLite
  package.


GAPsurvey 2025.08.06 (August 6, 2025)
----------------------------------------------------------------

BUG FIX

- Changed approach to timezone conversion in convert_nmea_btd()
  to prevent incorrect times in R < 4.3.0 and made handling of
  $GPZDA strings more flexible.
